 been working in the fitness industry for over 20 years and has over a decades experience as a trainer & assessor. Louise runs her own PT business as well as clocking up plentiful sector experience including leading exercise classes including group cycling and yoga for a variety of clients of varying ages an abilities. Louise is very active in her spare time and enjoys paddle-boarding, cycling and walking. It is Louise's role at Study Active to support learners and assess both their coursework and practical assessments.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1526531893007" style="min-height: auto;" data-id="1526531893007"><div class="gf_row gf_row-gap-15" id="r-1706792726715" data-label="Row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1706792726715" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="15px" style=""><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1526532216458" style="min-height: auto;" data-id="1526532216458"><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1706792726647" data-label="Image" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-id="1706792726647" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img class="gf_image" alt="" src="https://ucarecdn.com/1ae90f42-8f83-445f-82f0-cb7c5a6ec18e/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/kelly-anne.jpg" data-width="135px" data-height="" title="" natural-width="708" natural-height="767" width="708" height="767"></div></div><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1706792726540" data-label="Heading" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-id="1706792726540" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><h3 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Kelly-Anne O'Regan</h3><h3 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Trainer & Assessor</span><br></h3></div></div><div class="element-wrap" id="e-17067927266